{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbit Maze invites the player to a unique labyrinth world where they move forward by manipulating the direction of gravity. The sections that take place on cubes, spheres and other geometric surfaces are full of intelligence-based puzzles that challenge your sense of direction. Players must walk on different surfaces, progress without falling and reach the exit doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to use your reflexes and strategy while unlocking a new mechanic in each section. Orbit Maze offers an innovative look at classic platform games, while promising a memorable experience with its visual style and atmosphere. You will be able to access the first 3 sections of the game in the demo version.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744050?t=1752152182","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744050?t=1752152182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744050/2cfe3bd0c909424bbcc735c52887cb16accad776/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752152182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744050/2cfe3bd0c909424bbcc735c52887cb16accad776/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752152182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbit Maze invites the player to a unique labyrinth world where they move forward by manipulating the direction of gravity. The sections that take place on cubes, spheres and other geometric surfaces are full of intelligence-based puzzles that challenge your sense of direction. Players must walk on different surfaces, progress without falling and reach the exit doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to use your reflexes and strategy while unlocking a new mechanic in each section. Orbi